* GF180MCU Two-Stage CMOS Op-Amp Simulation
.lib "gf180mcu.lib" tt

* Power Supplies
Vdd vdd 0 DC 3.3
Vss vss 0 DC 0.0

* Bias Generator (Current Mirror Reference)
M8 vbias vbias vss vss nfet_03v3 W=10.0u L=0.5u
Rbias vdd vbias 40k

* Differential Pair & Tail Current Sink
M5 n_tail vbias vss vss nfet_03v3 W=20.0u L=0.5u
M1 n1 vin_minus n_tail vss nfet_03v3 W=10.0u L=0.5u
M2 n2 vin_plus  n_tail vss nfet_03v3 W=10.0u L=0.5u
M3 n1 n1 vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=20.0u L=0.5u
M4 n2 n1 vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=20.0u L=0.5u

* Second Gain Stage (Common-Source)
M6 vout n2 vdd vdd pfet_03v3 W=40.0u L=0.5u
M7 vout vbias vss vss nfet_03v3 W=40.0u L=0.5u

* Frequency Compensation & Load
Rz n2 n_cc 1k
Cc n_cc vout 1.2p
Cload vout 0 10p

* Input Stimulus (Common-mode + Differential AC)
Vin_cm in_cm 0 DC 1.65
Vac_diff ac_diff 0 DC 0 AC 1.0
E1 vin_plus  in_cm ac_diff 0 0.5
E2 vin_minus in_cm ac_diff 0 -0.5

* Transient Pulse for Time-Domain Plotting
Vin_step vin_step 0 PULSE(1.2 1.8 10u 100n 100n 500u 1m)

.ac dec 50 1 1G
.tran 10u 1m 0

* Control Statements
.control
run
print allv > plot_data_v.txt
print alli > plot_data_i.txt
.endc
.end
